@startuml
title Будущее 2.0 - Event Storming

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #4A5568
  LifeLineBorderColor #CBD5E0
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F7FAFC
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A5568
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EDF2F7
  ParticipantFontColor #1A202C
}

participant "Patient & Clinic\nOperations" as Clinic
participant "Clinical Records\n& Diagnostics" as Clinical
participant "Medical AI\nServices" as AI
participant "Fintech\nServices" as Fintech
queue "Event Streaming\nPlatform" as Events
participant "Data Products &\nSelf-Service Analytics" as Analytics
participant "Governance\n& Access" as Governance
participant "Legacy\nCompatibility" as Legacy

== Пациентский поток ==
Clinic -> Events : PatientRegistered
Clinic -> Events : AppointmentScheduled
Clinic -> Events : ClinicVisitCompleted
Clinic -> Events : ClinicInvoiceIssued
Events -> Analytics : данные для разрешенной аналитики
Events -> Fintech : основание для оплаты или кредита

== Медицинский контур ==
Clinical -> Events : TreatmentPrescribed
Clinical -> Events : DiagnosticStudyCompleted\n(только факт, без результатов)
Clinical -> Events : MedicalRecordUpdated\n(без содержимого карты)
Clinical -> Events : AiAnalysisRequested
Events -> AI : событие для ИИ-анализа

AI -> Events : AiAnalysisCompleted
AI -> Events : AiRecommendationPrepared
Events -> Clinical : результат для врача

== Финтех ==
Fintech -> Events : AccountOpened
Fintech -> Events : PaymentCompleted
Fintech -> Events : CreditContractCreated
Fintech -> Events : CreditStatusChanged
Events -> Analytics : финансовые data products

== Data products и доступ ==
Analytics -> Events : DataProductPublished
Analytics -> Events : ReportCreated
Analytics -> Events : DataProductDeprecated
Events -> Governance : регистрация и контроль витрин

Governance -> Events : AccessPolicyChanged
Governance -> Events : EventSchemaRegistered
Governance -> Events : DataProductCertified
Events -> Clinic : схемы и политики
Events -> Clinical : схемы и политики
Events -> AI : схемы и политики
Events -> Fintech : схемы и политики
Events -> Analytics : схемы и политики

== Миграция legacy ==
Legacy -> Events : LegacyRecordImported
Legacy -> Events : LegacyEventMapped
Events -> Analytics : исторические данные через ACL

note over Clinical, Analytics
  Медицинские карты, истории болезни и результаты исследований
  не публикуются в self-service аналитику.
end note

note over Legacy
  Legacy Compatibility нужен как временный anti-corruption layer
  для DWH, Camel и PowerBuilder.
end note

@enduml
